WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Stand close. Hold E or Help for 5 seconds.
Split up: teammates can light different beacons together.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Hold E or Help beside a captured friend for 3 seconds.
A rescued friend gets a short protection window.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Your blaster stuns the hunter. Fire, then move away.
Use walls, quiet bushes and your gadget to break the chase.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Three lit beacons open the southern portal.
Hold E or Help inside it for 1.5 seconds. Walking over it is not enough.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Get 3 of the 4 runners out before time runs out.
One pet escaping is not the win. Bring your friends home!
